[0m21:51:45.837458 [debug] [Thread-2 (]: On model.gn_dw_silver.DIM_CAMPAIGN: /* {"app": "dbt", "dbt_version": "1.9.4", "profile_name": "default", "target_name": "dev", "node_id": "model.gn_dw_silver.DIM_CAMPAIGN"} */
